<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Connect Jenkins to Rancher Manager via the Rancher API (Bearer token).
  Global configuration under Manage Jenkins → System (<b>Rancher Manager</b>);
  Freestyle/Pipeline steps: <b>Rancher Manifest Deployment</b> (<code>rancherManifest</code>)
  and <b>Rancher Helm Deployment</b> (<code>rancherHelm</code>).
</div>
